window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v26-018-906e37d5473d0b08.json"]={sha256:"906e37d5473d0b083bd3ee72f6e1df797b98c4e86b01e12f9b4a3340d228bae1",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-c9eab9c7f7058e67","url":"https://docs.olcf.ornl.gov/systems/summit_user_guide.html","title":"Summit hardware threads","titleEn":"Summit hardware threads","publisher":"Oak Ridge Leadership Computing Facility","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-018","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-018","related":[{"id":"hpc-v26-019","referenceUrls":["https://www.cs.utexas.edu/~flame/pubs/GotoTOMS_final.pdf"],"title":"GotoBLAS 式分塊：矩陣資料重用","titleEn":"GotoBLAS-style blocking: matrix data reuse","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付槽分類、SMT對照與資源競爭假說；.45/.65與槽守恆成立，報告不將利用率直接當應用速度比；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver slot categories, SMT comparisons and resource-contention hypotheses. Verify 0.45/0.65 and slot conservation without equating utilization to application speedup. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"標A行塊、B列塊、C累加塊與外迴圈次序；重用來自迴圈安排而非僅有方塊名稱；24576/98304正確，尾端覆蓋65×65且預算包含額外緩衝。","differenceEn":"Label A-row, B-column and C-accumulator tiles with loop order; reuse comes from ordering, not naming tiles. Counts match, all 65×65 outputs are covered and extra buffers enter the budget.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["有用利用率U=有用發射槽/可用槽，等待與重做都不計有用；每次觀測1000槽，單執行緒有用450；雙執行緒合計有用650，含重做50槽另列；名義式 450/1000 = 0.45 useful utilization；變更式 650/1000 = 0.65 useful utilization。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","FP64的A、B、C各b×b塊，理想工作集M=3b²×8 bytes，忽略額外打包與對齊；教學b32對64；可用快取預算96KiB，並非某處理器真實快取；名義式 3*32**2*8 = 24576 bytes；變更式 3*64**2*8 = 98304 bytes。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Useful utilization U=useful issued slots/available slots; waits and repeated work are excluded. Each observation has 1000 slots; one thread uses 450 usefully, two use 650, with 50 replay slots listed separately. Nominal 450/1000 = 0.45 useful utilization; changed 650/1000 = 0.65 useful utilization. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Three FP64 b×b tiles have ideal working set M=3 b²×8 bytes, excluding extra packing/alignment. Teaching b 32 versus 64 with 96 KiB available cache budget, not a processor specification. Nominal 3*32**2*8 = 24576 bytes; changed 3*64**2*8 = 98304 bytes. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v26-028","referenceUrls":["https://www.fftw.org/fftw3_doc/Complex-One_002dDimensional-DFTs.html"],"title":"FFTW：正反變換與正規化","titleEn":"FFTW: forward-inverse transforms and normalization","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付槽分類、SMT對照與資源競爭假說；.45/.65與槽守恆成立，報告不將利用率直接當應用速度比；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver slot categories, SMT comparisons and resource-contention hypotheses. Verify 0.45/0.65 and slot conservation without equating utilization to application speedup. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"畫輸入、正向頻譜、反向輸出及1/N步驟，註明複數實虛部與方向符號；24/48及還原3一致，報告含DFT符號、長度、stride與縮放。","differenceEn":"Draw the input, forward spectrum, inverse output, and 1/N scaling step. Label real and imaginary parts and transform signs. Verify 24/48 and recovered 3 with sign, length, stride and scaling documented.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["有用利用率U=有用發射槽/可用槽，等待與重做都不計有用；每次觀測1000槽，單執行緒有用450；雙執行緒合計有用650，含重做50槽另列；名義式 450/1000 = 0.45 useful utilization；變更式 650/1000 = 0.65 useful utilization。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","未正規化的正反DFT合成得到N×x；還原時需明確除N，而非假設函式庫自動除；合成N8，原始單元素x=3；改N16，同樣只觀察對應元素的正反合成；名義式 8*3 = 24 unnormalized reconstructed value；變更式 16*3 = 48 unnormalized reconstructed value。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Useful utilization U=useful issued slots/available slots; waits and repeated work are excluded. Each observation has 1000 slots; one thread uses 450 usefully, two use 650, with 50 replay slots listed separately. Nominal 450/1000 = 0.45 useful utilization; changed 650/1000 = 0.65 useful utilization. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Unnormalized forward/inverse DFTs compose to N×x; recovery explicitly divides by N. Synthetic N 8, original element x 3; compare N 16 at the same forward-inverse element. Nominal 8*3 = 24 unnormalized reconstructed value; changed 16*3 = 48 unnormalized reconstructed value. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-f352cb20160589f3","url":"https://www.cs.utexas.edu/~flame/pubs/GotoTOMS_final.pdf","title":"Anatomy of high-performance matrix multiplication","titleEn":"Anatomy of high-performance matrix multiplication","publisher":"Goto and van de Geijn / University of Texas","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-dd2130a397dcffb9","url":"https://www.fftw.org/fftw3_doc/Complex-One_002dDimensional-DFTs.html","title":"FFTW one-dimensional DFTs","titleEn":"FFTW one-dimensional DFTs","publisher":"FFTW authors","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
